  "recordType": "rule-part",
  "ruleText": "PART He-W 775 PROGRAM OPTIONS - RESERVED\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for He-W 700) #5133, eff 5-2-91; ss by #6507, INTERIM, eff 5-1-97, EXPIRES: 8-29-97; rpld by #6549, eff 8-1-97\n\nAPPENDIX A\n\nAPPENDIX B\n\nPursuant to He-W 742.02(j), the SUA amounts listed below are the annual updates effective October 1, 2026 and will continue in effect through September 30, 2027.\n\nSUA | Monthly Allowance\n\nHeat | $1054\n\nUtilities only | $386\n\nElectric only | $225\n\nTelephone only | $40",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w700.html"
